ys and Solving Two Sum in Java (Live Stream)"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"talk-meta","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"talk-event","children":"Twitch Stream"}],["$","time",null,{"className":"talk-date","children":"February 24, 2024"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"talk-description","children":"This livestream session explores two classic coding problems in Java: merging two sorted arrays and solving the Two Sum problem. The stream includes detailed walkthroughs of each solution, emphasizes the use of test-driven development, and demonstrates how to manage iteration, edge cases, and debugging in Java. Designed as part of an ongoing effort to practice algorithms and data structures live."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"talk-topics","children":[["$","span","Java",{"className":"topic-tag","children":"Java"}],["$","span","Algorithms",{"className":"topic-tag","children":"Algorithms"}],["$","span","Merging Arrays",{"className":"topic-tag","children":"Merging Arrays"}],["$","span","Two Sum",{"className":"topic-tag","children":"Two Sum"}],["$","span","Data Structures",{"className":"topic-tag","children":"Data Structures"}],["$","span","Edge Cases",{"className":"topic-tag","children":"Edge Cases"}],["$","span","Test-Driven Development",{"className":"topic-tag","children":"Test-Driven Development"}],["$","span","Debugging",{"className":"topic-tag","children":"Debugging"}],["$","span","Live Coding",{"className":"topic-tag","children":"Live Coding"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","article","stream-java-dsa-from-scratch",{"className":"talk-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"talk-video","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-9CCDqSwuvA","title":"Learning Java Together | Data Structures & Algorithms | Practicing Array Fundamentals (Live Stream)","frameBorder":"0","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true,"className":"youtube-embed"}]}],["$","div",null,{"classNam